  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "<solar/>Solar Kills extend the duration of <solar/>Restoration and <solar/>Radiant effects up to the maximum of 15 seconds.\n\nScoring a <solar/>Solar Kill while <solar/>Restoration's or <solar/>Radiant's timer is above 15 seconds will lower it back down to 15 seconds.\n\nSeconds added based on <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\n• Tier 1 (T1) Minors: 1.5s\n• T2 Minors, T1 Elites: 2.25s\n• T3 Minors, T2 Elites, Enemy Players: 3s\n• T4 Minors, T3 Elites, and higher: 6s",
      "updatedAt": "2024-06-29T10:29:23.809Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
